name=Cookie - Early Hooks
id=CookieEarlyHooks
description=Part of Cookie - Server Patches. Loads before the other mods, so it can see or swap handlers they add while loading. Now: REVIVAL zombie handler made cheaper (zombies act the same); Cookie Square Queue: in a player's game, the work every mod does for each map square that loads runs a little at a time over the next frames instead of all in one frame, work only the server needs (Kentucky Cannabis, ZVirusVaccine, Daily Challenge) is skipped there, and while the player's vehicle moves that work for squares inside buildings waits until it stops or the player gets out, so buildings only driven past are skipped; the square work of Kentucky Cannabis, Dynamic Outposts, Arcadia Lifestyle and Monorails is also made lighter (same results, smoother driving); on the server, AliveJeem's base zombie safety keeps running the moment a chunk loads, before its rooms get zombies, also when the Cookie Slicer server agent runs the other mods' square work later; Cookie Throttle: Lifestyle invention items refreshed 4 times a second instead of every frame (players' games); HDs Food Recipes with one of its spawn options off: its loot filter runs only on real containers, so bags rolled inside containers no longer throw an error each time; and Cookie Profiler: measures how much time each mod's Lua takes (off unless the file Zomboid/Lua/CookieProfile_client.txt or CookieProfile_server.txt exists; then it writes a report there every minute). Keep it at the top of the mod list.
loadModBefore=\JaxeRevival
versionMin=42.0.0
